Read a file by path with line numbers. `offset` is 1-based; the default limit is {{ .DefaultReadLimit }} lines. Supports images (PNG, JPEG, GIF, WebP); images are capped at {{ .MaxImageSizeKB }}KB. The returned text content section is capped at {{ .MaxViewSizeKB }}KB. Use `ls` for directories and `grep` or `glob` to find files. Prefer this over `cat`, `head`, or `sed`. Builtin skills are read through `crush://skills/...` locations.
